#import "/_lib/0.1.1.typ": *
#show: template

#taxon[Definition]
#title[general cartesian decomposion]

We define a _cartesian decomposition_ of a finite set $S$ to be a term of the type
$
  "general-cart-dec" (S) :-= sum_(A,B : "FinSet")(A xx_"FinSet" B  ~= S).
$
Where $xx_"FinSet"$ is the #local("00DZ")[cartesian product in FinSet].
